{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>In the wilderness of Sinai, etc.</b> Our Rabbis of blessed memory drew forth precious insights in this verse (Numbers Rabbah 1:1), but it remains to raise the question of why HaShem did not balance His measurements of the words equally. For when He mentioned the identification of the place, He preceded the general designation, which is 'the wilderness of Sinai,' and afterward He mentioned the specific place and said <b>in the Tent of Meeting</b>; whereas when He mentioned the identification of the time, He preceded the specific mention of the time and said <b>on the first day of the second month</b>, and afterward He mentioned the general designation of the time and said <b>in the second year.</b>" "<b>And it will be seen</b> that the verse, on the contrary, was wise to speak with equal measure, and it is along the lines of their statement (Exodus Rabbah 45:6): ״הִנֵּה מָקוֹם אִתִּי״ — 'His place' of the Holy One, blessed be He, is subordinate to Him. By this measure, every place is subordinate relative to the place where Elohim encamps there. From this perspective, the general designation is the Tent of Meeting, and the wilderness is a subordinate particular to it. And to demonstrate to you, the verse with this intention arranged next to it the statement <b>on the first day of the month, etc.</b> <b>in the second year</b> — if so, the statement 'in the Tent of Meeting' is the general designation, and therefore it was arranged last, in parallel to the order of 'in the second year,' which was arranged after the statement 'on the first day of the month.' And you shall know how supremely exalted is the place where HaShem is, from what we find: that within the two cubits between the poles of the ark stood the spirits of sixty myriad of Israel (Genesis Rabbah 4:4; 5:6) — see then that even though it is visually small, it is vast by virtue of the blessed One who dwells within it."], :book :numbers, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T20:05:52.585386178Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}